sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Dashboard
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Reconciler as Payload Reconciler
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>(PVC/MinIO/DB)
    participant ModelMesh as ModelMesh Serving
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant Knative as Knative Eventing
    participant ModelServer as Model Server<br/>(gRPC plaintext)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitor)

    Note over TrustyAI: Flow 1: ModelMesh Inference Data Ingestion
    ModelMesh->>TrustyAI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (plaintext)<br/>Inference input/output payloads
    TrustyAI->>Reconciler: ConsumerEndpoint → ModelMeshInferencePayloadReconciler<br/>Match input/output by ID
    Reconciler->>Storage: Persist reconciled inference data<br/>(PVC filesystem / MinIO HTTP / DB JDBC)

    Note over TrustyAI: Flow 2: KServe Inference Data Ingestion (CloudEvents)
    KServe->>Knative: Emit inference CloudEvents<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.request<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.response
    Knative->>TrustyAI: POST CloudEvent<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (plaintext)
    TrustyAI->>Reconciler: CloudEventConsumer → KServeInferencePayloadReconciler<br/>Match request/response by ID
    Reconciler->>Storage: Persist reconciled inference data<br/>Tag: UNLABELED (organic) vs SYNTHETIC

    Note over TrustyAI: Flow 3: Explainability Request (disabled in RHOAI profile)
    Client->>TrustyAI: POST /explainers/local/lime<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (plaintext)<br/>Auth: delegated to kube-rbac-proxy
    TrustyAI->>ModelServer: gRPC ModelInfer RPC<br/>KServe V2 protocol (plaintext)<br/>Synthetic inference probes
    ModelServer-->>TrustyAI: gRPC ModelInferResponse<br/>Prediction results
    TrustyAI-->>Client: JSON saliency response<br/>HTTP 200

    Note over TrustyAI: Flow 4: Fairness/Drift Metric Request
    Client->>TrustyAI: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (plaintext)<br/>Auth: delegated to kube-rbac-proxy
    TrustyAI->>Storage: Read inference data<br/>(batch read from storage)
    Storage-->>TrustyAI: Inference dataframes
    TrustyAI-->>Client: JSON metric result<br/>(SPD value, timestamps, metadata)

    Note over TrustyAI: Flow 5: Scheduled Metric Publication
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: PrometheusScheduler (cron trigger)<br/>Compute all scheduled metrics
    TrustyAI->>Storage: Read inference data for each model
    Storage-->>TrustyAI: Inference dataframes
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: PrometheusPublisher<br/>Update Micrometer gauges<br/>(trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir, etc.)
    Prometheus->>TrustyAI: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP<br/>Auth: Bearer SA token
    TrustyAI-->>Prometheus: Prometheus exposition format<br/>trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir gauges
